{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:67113d22c8c13cca31c6e6c9e51fc03d9c4b3f7e557c02ce6d98ff5d5a5040ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67df9cd002cfd6f5a6e7079967a627b9ea1f92c021daf3b9674683755e0b1e7",
      "text": "绝不能对有困难的家伙坐视不管！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df31bdaef8b4469def6f5f9d544835802728168c7420499644aa4d1f98e66d71",
      "text": "某天，朱雀和玄武在巡逻途中\n被外校的不良少年纠缠。为了不在现场\n起冲突而转移阵地的途中，\n朱雀和玄武所救下的“某个人物”，\n推动了两人的命运。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67df9cd002cfd6f5a6e7079967a627b9ea1f92c021daf3b9674683755e0b1e7",
      "text": "绝不能对有困难的家伙坐视不管！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134c13fc19a328b9106e3b797bdad4559feb69af126bbfe5b3b4862c20b46e7e",
      "text": "这边……看来没有什么异常啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17705fd25d412b3a9fb9f2b2fab5d49dd76732833d1dfa545bc1027fa13c0516",
      "text": "虽然听说有抢包贼出没\n才出来巡逻，但这一带挺太平的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bed5d1628119f2e72ddf43086f4bf4ba03b446f61a75f46bea80e9604bcc9bd",
      "text": "太平固然是好事……\n但大意不得，犯人还没落网呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf91ea7efdc161adf249fe323fe485d69c571491649c2ecb77318709a51c3d0",
      "text": "就这样继续巡逻吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff4eba4d3bfe5dc5ddd1a56946ba8d67225dbb3b3e3aa0560ecdc82ca8f6048",
      "text": "噢！今天一定要用狠眼神瞪住坏蛋，\n让他们不敢再干坏事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9fd4c1c1ef5f4b48d13ac951cd59ea52de96b9c27110bb708fee908af48ad1",
      "text": "喔喔，喵子也很有干劲嘛！\n好嘞，就按这个势头冲啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1fc283cb049fa487ebb29c250b2f866407e3fb3ae8f625f6538e55a736bfac",
      "text": "喵喵喵喵——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb2b26b739f8a396da1c69ea1c0b8c7054df34ff2a907847a2ba9f0aca18afe",
      "text": "唔，喂，有精神是好事，\n但别往我这边扑过来啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0028a5880d149dd99796806066663ad050e392c87d299ec1d21702dc387bfb2",
      "text": "玄武对猫过敏嘛。\n不过，隔着这么远走就没问题了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99cd45d24a66009105834cb1ec914b54088b2b364072496a0a2d17d6ed8cefd1",
      "text": "喵子也别太靠近玄武哦。\n他会打喷嚏停不下来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
